### ================================================================
### SECTION 10: COMPLETE PUSH GATING TEST SCENARIO
### ================================================================
### This test verifies the fix for push notifications when app is open.
### Steps:
### 1. Set active_conversation to null (on listings)
### 2. Send message from B -> Push SHOULD arrive
### 3. Set active_conversation to this conversation
### 4. Send message from B -> Push SHOULD NOT arrive (WS delivers)
### 5. Set active_conversation to null
### 6. Send message from B -> Push SHOULD arrive again
### ================================================================

### 10.1 Step 1: User A is on listings (not in conversation)
WEBSOCKET ws://localhost:8080/ws/chat?token={{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "active_conversation",
  "payload": {"conversation_id": null},
  "request_id": "push-test-01"
}

> {%
    response.body.onEachMessage((message, unsubscribe) => {
        const json = JSON.parse(message);
        client.log("Step 1 (listings): " + message);
        if (json.request_id === "push-test-01") {
            unsubscribe();
        }
    });
%}

### 10.2 Step 3: User A enters the conversation
WEBSOCKET ws://localhost:8080/ws/chat?token={{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "active_conversation",
  "payload": {"conversation_id": "{{conversationId}}"},
  "request_id": "push-test-03"
}

> {%
    response.body.onEachMessage((message, unsubscribe) => {
        const json = JSON.parse(message);
        client.log("Step 3 (entered conversation): " + message);
        if (json.request_id === "push-test-03") {
            unsubscribe();
        }
    });
%}

### 10.3 Step 5: User A leaves conversation (back to listings)
WEBSOCKET ws://localhost:8080/ws/chat?token={{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "active_conversation",
  "payload": {"conversation_id": null},
  "request_id": "push-test-05"
}

> {%
    response.body.onEachMessage((message, unsubscribe) => {
        const json = JSON.parse(message);
        client.log("Step 5 (back to listings): " + message);
        if (json.request_id === "push-test-05") {
            unsubscribe();
        }
    });
%}

